{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43500","headline":"送薛大夫和蕃 · 无名氏","name":"送薛大夫和蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戎王归汉命，魏绦谕皇恩。\n旌斾辞双阙，风沙上五原。\n往途遵塞道，出祖耀都门。\n策令天文盛，宣威使者尊。\n澄波望四海，入贡伫诸蕃。\n秋杪迎回骑，无劳枉梦魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}